&lt;li&gt;Own partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline creation and revenue attainment for Atlas deals with AWS Cloud sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive enablement and field alignment activities to convert co-sell plays into closed-won revenue with AWS Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
