&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Infrastructure as Code technologies such as Terraform and Helm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills in Golang and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation and internal engineering platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
