&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer - Full-stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology—anywhere, on any device or app. Our Workforce and Customer Identity Clouds enable secure yet flexible access, authentication, and automation that transforms how people move through the digital world, putting Identity at the heart of business security and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box—we are looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences and backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team! We are building a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity Security Pillar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Identity Security Pillar&lt;/strong&gt; is at the forefront of defending modern enterprise environments against sophisticated identity-centric attacks. As enterprise attack surfaces expand across clouds, SaaS ecosystems, and hybrid networks, our pillar delivers unified, next-generation security capabilities that protect organizations across the entire threat lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our pillar gives you the unique opportunity to build and impact diverse, cutting-edge products across the security domain, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity Security Posture Management (ISPM):&lt;/strong&gt; Delivering continuous, contextual visibility into complex identity infrastructure, surfacing misconfigurations, eliminating toxic combinations of permissions, and reducing overall attack surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity Threat Protection (ITP):&lt;/strong&gt; ITP delivers real-time, surgical defense against the most sophisticated and rapidly evolving threats. By deeply integrating with existing security infrastructure, ITP relentlessly analyzes user behavior and system data to proactively hunt down and neutralize risks before they impact our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity Threat Detection &amp;amp; Response (ITDR):&lt;/strong&gt; Detecting sophisticated credential compromise, privilege escalation, and lateral movement with speed and automated response capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we expand our engineering footprint in India, you will be a foundational member of a high-impact team driving architectural scale, technical innovation, and product synergy across this critical pillar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Software Engineer on the team, you will play a pivotal, hands-on role in scaling our foundational platforms and web applications, with a primary emphasis on backend architecture and distributed services. You will partner closely with distributed teams to deliver robust, high-performance security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build high-quality backend services while collaborating with frontend developers to ensure seamless integration across the stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on engineering excellence by improving standard methodologies, producing best-in-class code, documentation, testing, and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and R&amp;amp;D engineers to translate product requirements into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve technical issues and performance bottlenecks within the backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with the latest industry trends and technologies to continuously improve our backend services and overall application performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a mentor to colleagues and help promote knowledge sharing within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining complex, enterprise-grade distributed systems in high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of hands-on experience designing and implementing backend services using &lt;strong&gt;Node.js&lt;/strong&gt; and modern &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven working familiarity with modern frontend frameworks, specifically &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling seamless collaboration and full-stack ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep knowledge of RESTful API design, microservices architecture, asynchronous event-driven design, and data persistence patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database &amp;amp; Storage Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience working with relational databases as well as NoSQL/caching stores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Principles:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in computer science fundamentals, data structures, algorithms, and scalable software design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, paired with strong communication abilities to collaborate across distributed, global engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical discipline (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Credit: If You Have Experience In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks such as &lt;strong&gt;NestJS&lt;/strong&gt; or similar enterprise-grade Node.js server frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern cloud platforms (particularly &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;) and container orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and security domains (IAM, OAuth, OIDC, SAML, posture management, threat detection, or cloud security).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;P25712_3566359&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;312927a14432&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;312927a14432&quot;&gt;Authentication tells you who someone is. Authorization decides what they can do, and doing that well at scale is hard. Role-based access breaks down as applications grow, and AI agents are changing who, and what, asks for access. Auth0 &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt; solves this with fine-grained authorization. Its engine is OpenFGA, a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CNCF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; incubating open source project that Okta maintains with contributors from other companies, and Auth0 &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt; runs that same engine as a managed service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4439&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40de6dd0d021&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt; DevEx owns how developers experience both: our SDKs, CLI, IDE plugins, Helm charts and docs, all developed in the open. The &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt; group owns its product end to end, from infrastructure to docs, so we move quickly and see our work reach developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3af08bad5c12&quot;&gt;Our guiding principle: one developer experience, many deployment models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4690&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3af08bad5c12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43f0bc04f6db&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Engineer to set the technical direction for everything the team owns, and to mentor the senior engineers who build it, starting with our SDKs in Go, JavaScript, .NET, Python, Java and more. From there, you&#39;ll shape where the developer experience goes next, from how our SDKs evolve to new surfaces like &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MCP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; servers. You&#39;ll partner with the Core team on API design, so every new capability feels natural in each language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5225&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aec80b36d61a&quot;&gt;This is an individual contributor role. You&#39;ll work closely with the engineering manager, who owns people and delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5225&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aec80b36d61a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the direction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5387&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba01009ee862&quot;&gt;Define and drive the technical direction for &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt; DevEx across open source and SaaS, and turn it into a roadmap with the engineering manager and the product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5552&quot; data-local-id=&quot;68eb3af3e2be&quot;&gt;Build support for that direction across the team, the FGA group and open source community&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5650&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5583cd6d83e0&quot;&gt;Mentor the team&#39;s senior engineers, and raise the level of everyone around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5733&quot; data-local-id=&quot;621b04896eb0&quot;&gt;Establish how a new team builds software, from design reviews and coding standards to how we test and ship, and set the quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5869&quot; data-local-id=&quot;56fdccf67afc&quot;&gt;Make the calls that are hard to undo: when an API is ready to ship across every language, how it evolves, and when to deprecate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6001&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6b0f2189653&quot;&gt;Be the voice of developer experience across &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FGA&lt;/span&gt;: partner with the Core team on API design and with internal teams such as Integrations, and flag developer friction wherever you see it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Platform:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6209&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98b3cf6aa962&quot;&gt;Architect our SDKs in Go, JavaScript, .NET, Python and Java, including the generator every client is built from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6325&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf7f6dc1b80b&quot;&gt;Set the standards every SDK follows, from authentication and error handling to retries and rate limiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6434&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6f9aa879c2a0&quot;&gt;Shape the tooling and content around the SDKs: the CLI, IDE integrations, Helm charts, GitHub automation, docs and examples.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ffb108d6c8a&quot;&gt;Drive the release and versioning strategy across all divisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6625&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c7355b96cfc0&quot;&gt;Grow our open source community: build the contributor and maintainer base beyond the team today, and make it easy for outside developers to contribute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6798&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15c4cdf15586&quot;&gt;8+ years as a software engineer, including time leading the technical direction of a team or a significant area, with or without the title.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6941&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90228467d0a4&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one of Go, JavaScript/TypeScript, C#/.NET, Python or Java, and the curiosity to work across several.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7076&quot; data-local-id=&quot;df76899b5e69&quot;&gt;Experience building software other developers use: SDKs, API clients, libraries, developer platforms, CLIs or tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7198&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3aad4beb6c4d&quot;&gt;A strong sense of API design and ergonomics, and of how an interface should feel in different languages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7198&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3aad4beb6c4d&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;6a6f994e-6a07-4d3f-b075-8c2d3ace5830&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;6a6f994e-6a07-4d3f-b075-8c2d3ace5830&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/mark&gt;Clear communication and a track record of influencing decisions across teams and with outside contributors, without relying on authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7448&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d9d646af084a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7464&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6f8bd871f85f&quot;&gt;Contributing to, maintaining or leading open source projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7529&quot; data-local-id=&quot;80638a2a6ddc&quot;&gt;Building with code generation tools such as OpenAPI Generator and templating frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7621&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0da07ae83704&quot;&gt;Designing resilient clients: authentication flows, retries and rate limiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7702&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71574706c590&quot;&gt;Setting up GitHub Actions and release automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9282dc656e58&quot;&gt;Working in authorization or identity, such as OAuth, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RBAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; or &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ReBAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#P24601_3385572&lt;/p&gt;
