&lt;li&gt;Drive initial prospect qualification and schedule discovery meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, present, and implement strategies for acquiring new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct outbound outreach by cold calling and emailing prospective customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to follow a well-defined methodology to help identify a customer&#39;s unique needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
